## ENDPOINT:The URL an API is accessed from
## CALL: A request made to an API
## API: Application Programming Interface
## Response: What the API returns when a call is made
## JSON: JavaScript Object Notation
## ENTITY: A record in an API
## POST:To add new data to an API
## GET: To pull data from an API
## PUT:To update a whole record in an API
## PATCH: To update a part of a record in an API
## DELETE: To remove a record from an API